sequenceDiagram
    actor Keeper as "Warehouse Keeper"
    actor Approver as "Admin/authorized Operator"
    participant UI as "Interface: UI"
    participant API as "mainController: Controller"
    participant Inv as "inventoryService: Service"
    participant Blob as "evidenceStorage: External System"
    participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
    Keeper->>UI: Select damaged/expired quantity and attach evidence
    UI->>+API: POST inventory lock/write-off request
    API->>Inv: Validate warehouse scope and eligible quantity
    Inv->>DB: Lock quantity before write-off
    Inv->>Blob: Store evidence reference
    Inv->>DB: Save pending write-off and audit
    Approver->>UI: Review write-off
    UI->>+API: Approve write-off
    API->>Inv: Approve with current version
    alt Quantity and evidence valid
        Inv->>DB: Reduce OnHand, mark disposed and finalize transaction
        API-->>-UI: Write-off approved
    else Reserved/locked conflict or over-quantity
        Inv->>DB: Keep NeedsHandling/lock state; no negative stock
        API-->>-UI: Conflict requiring authorized resolution
    end


